= Attack on Léon Blum

As Léon Blum, political leader of the SFIO, traveled through Paris, right-wing students of the reactionary and royalist Camelots du Roi physically assaulted him, leaving him seriously injured and hospitalized.

In response to the assault, the Popular Front launches a mass protest, and once more calls for the disbandment of the far-right leagues.

- @root: Fascism must be stopped...
